Package: rjd3report
Type: Package
Title: Quality Assessment and Reporting for Seasonal Adjustment
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
   person("Alain", "Quartier-la-Tente", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                 email = "alain.quartier@yahoo.fr",
                 comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7890-3857")))
Description: Add-in to the 'rjd3x13' and 'rjd3tramoseats' packages on seasonal adjustments.
    It allows to produce quality assessments outputs (such as dashboards) and
    reports (with 'Quarto') describing seasonal adjustment models.
License: EUPL
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 21), Quarto (optional, to render reports)
